{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061170/block/singleImage/3253374/df/01M65V8C090NRH5785BCHEBB3H.webp?updatedAt=1793345233\"/><figcaption>清水灣發生交通意外。（有線電視新聞截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>清水灣發生交通意外。 今日（30日）早上10時23分，一輛私家車沿西貢清水灣大坳門道、往將軍澳方向行駛，其間司機報稱避狗，扭右軚後失控鏟上行人路再翻側，司機一度被困車內。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防將他救出，他受輕傷由救護車清醒送往將軍澳醫院治理。警方正在調查意外原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:54.452737+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:07:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:10.264539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:14.048174+00:00","content_hash":"51bb4f67a05bdc9a7e9730bbb3bf87c41327d2261806587a8d04ea9c68d89ab2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}